<div class="card"><h3>Main floor = piano lounge</h3><p>Steinway B as the focal point of the 21′4″ × 18′9″ great room, lid opening toward the fireplace; two black leather cigar chairs and the tufted bench at the hearth; the carved mirror panel over the mantel.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Lower level = movie, speakeasy, two bedrooms + office</h3><p>Our 14′ × 10′6″ L-sectional in the family-room corner facing the 75″ TV and a square coffee table, massage chair in the same room. Behind the hinged bookcase: a speakeasy in the room as it is (existing walls, ceiling and floor unchanged, plus a rug), with Jenny’s 42″ × 42″ espresso high-top table (36″ tall) with 4 matching counter chairs, and her oak-and-marble bar cart. Bedroom 2 (kids’ room) and Bedroom 3 (teen room, later guest) are furnished. The glass desk and Aeron move to an office in the storage / utility room.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Garage = CrossFit box + one lift + mini office</h3><p>Gym of about 670 sf with the 8×8 platform and rig under the 13 ft center, a stretch / bodyweight / TV corner at the back left, cold plunge, and an open mini office of about 99 sf, defined by IKEA furniture rather than walls, with a new standing desk at the rear south window. The existing gray workbench and cabinet run stays; the movable gray steel shelving goes to basement storage. The Airstream stays in the 12×12. One 4-post lift in the right bay (Model Y under, 911 on top), the XT5 parks in the left bay, and the Wall Connector is on the front wall of the right bay. The stair walkway stays clear.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Garage recovery corner = cold plunge + infrared sauna</h3><p>A 3-person full-spectrum infrared sauna with a red light therapy panel in its glass door, in the rear-right corner of the garage gym. Its door faces the cold plunge across a 30″ wet mat, so you step out of the plunge straight into the sauna. The GHD, reverse hyper and benches are rearranged around it, with three new outlets on the stair wall. <a href="#prefab-sauna">Layout and details</a>.</p></div></div></section>

