<section id="prefab-sauna"><h2>Infrared sauna + red light panel in the garage gym, one step from the cold plunge</h2>
<p>Updated Nov 27, 2026: this is the sauna plan we’re going with. A <b>3-person</b> prefab <b>full-spectrum infrared sauna</b> (far-infrared panels plus full-spectrum heater towers, up to 175°F) with an <b>integrated 7-wavelength red light therapy panel</b> in its door, set in the rear-right corner of the garage gym so its <b>glass door faces the cold plunge</b>: climb out of the plunge, take one step across the mat, and you are at the sauna door. It is an indoor unit, so the heated garage suits it. <b>Tap the plan</b> to open it full-size, or see it in 3D in the <a href="explorer.html?view=recovery">explorer</a>.</p>
